# Context for the Scheduler Lambda image (terraform/aws/lambda/scheduler/
# Dockerfile builds from this repo root). Only `cli/` and `entrypoint/` are
# copied; everything here either does not belong in a Linux image or would be
# copied only to be thrown away. `terraform/` stays: the bootstrap lives there.

# Installed on the developer's machine, for the developer's machine — biome
# ships a darwin binary. The image runs `bun install` itself.
**/node_modules

.git
.github
website
docs
worker
integrations
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
